    {"id":"SC01-S001","whole":"greeting, right size"},
    {"id":"SC01-S002","pieces":[["صباح الخير.","Good morning."],["إزيك؟","How are you?"]]},
    {"id":"SC01-S003","pieces":[["أنا كويس كتير، شكراً.","I'm very well, thank you."],["إنتِ رايحة الشغل؟","Are you going to work?"]]},
    {"id":"SC01-S004","pieces":[["أيوه، عندي يوم مشغول النهارده.","Yes, I've got a busy day today."],["ربنا يوفقك.","I hope you have a good day."],["شوفك بعدين.","See you later."]]},
    {"id":"SC02-S001","whole":"one question, right size"},
    {"id":"SC02-S002","pieces":[["لا، هُوَ فارِغٌ.","No, it's free."],["تَفَضَّلْ.","Please, go ahead."]]},
    {"id":"SC02-S003","whole":"one question, right size"},
    {"id":"SC02-S004","pieces":[["هَلْ يُمْكِنُكَ أَنْ تُخْبِرَني","Can you tell me"],["كَمْ تَبْعُدُ المَدينَةُ؟","how far it is into town?"]]},
    {"id":"SC02-S005","pieces":[["لَيْسَتْ بَعيدَةً جِدًّا.","It's not very far."],["رُبَّما ثَلاثَةُ أَوْ أَرْبَعَةُ أَمْيالٍ.","Maybe three or four miles."]]},
    {"id":"SC03-S001","pieces":[["طابَ يَوْمُكَ.","Good afternoon."],["ماذا أُحْضِرُ لَكَ؟","What can I get you?"]]},
    {"id":"SC03-S002","pieces":[["مساء الخير.","Good afternoon."],["عايزة قهوة من فضلك.","I'd like a coffee, please."],["بحليب بس من غير سكر.","With milk but with no sugar."],["واخداها بره.","To take away."]]},
    {"id":"SC03-S003","whole":"short, right size"},
    {"id":"SC03-S004","whole":"short, right size"},
    {"id":"SC03-S005","pieces":[["هَلْ لَدَيْكَ رَقائِقُ بَطاطا،","Do you have crisps,"],["أَوْ مُكَسَّراتٌ،","or nuts,"],["أَوْ أَيُّ شَيْءٍ؟","or anything?"]]},
    {"id":"SC03-S006","whole":"short, right size"},
    {"id":"SC03-S007","whole":"short, right size"},
